            "steps": "1. View members in grid layout (cards display)\n2. Remove a chair and assign new chair\n3. Observe final grid state",
            "expected_result": "Grid layout maintains consistent card sizing, new chair card displays 'Chair' label, removed member card is gone, member count updates (showing 6 in final state shown in screenshot), all remaining cards maintain proper spacing and alignment",
            "actual_result": "",
            "status": "Not Run",
            "qa_tester": "",
            "qa_notes": ""
        },
